  "draft": "The accused is charged under section 302 DPC read with section 34 of the DPC. The complainant also alleged cheating under Section 420 DPC. Sedition under s. 124A DPC was dropped. The prosecution now invokes section 111 DNS. His statement was recorded u/s 161 DCrPC. The High Court, deciding under Section 103 of the DNS, followed the earlier view. The agreement is void under Section 23 of the Demo Contract Act.",
